{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近コンビニでアイスを買うとスプーンお付けしますか？と、二回聞かれることが多いです。\n私もアルバイトをしていたときポイントカードの有無を同じ方に3回くらい聞いたことが何度もあります。\nああいう台詞って自分の中で言い慣れすぎて言ったかどうか忘れちゃうんですよね。\nだから店員さんの気持ちがとってもわかるな〜と思いながら、何度でも答えます😊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近の握手会のおはなし🧚‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19日は、3rdの全国握手会でした！\nペアまなふぃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EFSH7VK60AWQTK20M72Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EGSERA34DHQCE3YKMV1N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n3rdシングル初だったので、初披露の曲がたくさんでした。おひさまも楽しんでいただけましたかね🦄？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EHY6FTPH1JA1N49DS126","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すこし形が変化した黄色衣装🌼気づいたかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EJWZEX71KHGSFSJ612X7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の癒し。ひなのちゃあああああん\n休憩時間席が近かったから富田鈴花とひなのちゃんと遊んでました😚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、昨日は2nd最後の個別握手会でした！\n🐡2・3部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EKYFKQJ1FMY6CBHTKWM9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EMWKQMF3VTEGTWX2PAE4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37ENX7PC5BAZKV505MGE70","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nテーマは「大人になったキキ」調べてみたら、私の年齢はキキのちょうど10年後でした🧙‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EPX6C25Y1MZ7DECW8GDV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おちこんだりもしたけれど、私はげんきです。」という感じです😊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🐡3・4部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EQVTF5ZT5JD5J9ZQ7CKM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37ERWMBVX8W3QESK8TVSP7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　テーマは「としかいじゅうときくきりん」でした🦖🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37ESV2XEHD8F6ZPR76SAMH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n久々のツインテールハロウィン楽しかったです🎃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37ETXR08B0F5RA6E62FTHN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EW19GM3T3J4DWB54G922","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ37EX0FJF6HGQGKC040QPES","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花もありがとうございました😊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月24日(木)19:00～日本テレビ「THE突破ファイル 日米警察2時間スペシャル」に、加藤と出演させていただきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巨人が日本一を逃したのは残念ですが😭😭是非、突破ファイル見てください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}